%I A398476 #16 Aug 18 2026 00:12:13
%S A398476 1,0,1,3,13,60,511,5393,120017,3856376,277897034
%N A398476 Number of singular simple connected graphs on n unlabeled nodes.
%C A398476 A singular graph has an adjacency matrix with determinant zero.
%C A398476 Generated using an exhaustive enumeration that correctly generates A001349.
%H A398476 Felix Flicker, <a href="https://github.com/felixflicker/singular_connected_graphs">singular_connected_graphs</a>, GitHub. This code was used to generate the sequence.
%H A398476 Brendan D. McKay and Adolfo Piperno, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jsc.2013.09.003">Practical graph isomorphism, II</a>, Journal of Symbolic Computation, 60 (2014), pp. 94-112.
%e A398476 For n=3 the graph with edges {(1,2),(2,3)} is singular, but adding (3,1) it is not.
%Y A398476 Cf. A001349, A133206.
%K A398476 nonn,more,new
